    "code": "# Sleeps past its 500 ms limit in wall-clock terms but exits cleanly with\n# almost no CPU. The clean-exit guard must keep this AC.\nimport sys\nimport time\n\na, b = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\ntime.sleep(2)\nprint(a + b)\n",
